    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d374-a3">

                <pb facs="0692" n="630" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg630"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    802.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Romero to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 17,
                        1878</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Unofficial.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Esteemed Sir</hi>: In reply to your favor of
                    to-day, with which you are pleased to transmit to me two letters and one coupon,
                    which I return, I inclose a copy of the report in regard to the subject which
                    the respective section of this department has made.</p>
                <p>I repeat myself on this occasion your attentive and faithful servant,</p>
                <closer><signed>M. ROMERO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., present.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
